---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Trademark Classes in India | NICE Classification Guide";
const description = "Understand Indian trademark classes under the NICE classification system. Identify the right goods and services classes for your brand with BRNDNUR.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/trademark-classes/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/trademark-classes/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Classification Guidance</p>
        <h1>Find the Right Trademark Class for Your Brand.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Under the Trade Marks Act, 1999, trademarks in India are classified into 45 distinct categories based on the international NICE classification system. Choosing the correct class ensures your statutory protection aligns with what you actually sell.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20need%20help%20identifying%20my%20trademark%20class." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Request Class Consultation &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/brand-name-search/">Check Brand Name</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">The System</p>
          <h2>Goods (Classes 1–34) vs. Services (Classes 35–45)</h2>
          <p>Every commercial offering falls under either physical manufactured goods or commercial services. Here is how key industries are structured:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🍎</div>
            <h3>Class 29 & 30 — Food & Beverages</h3>
            <p>Class 29 covers meat, fish, preserved fruits, oils, and dairy. Class 30 covers spices, tea, coffee, bakery products, confectionery, and packaged snacks.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/packages/food-brand/">View Food Package &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">👕</div>
            <h3>Class 25 — Clothing & Footwear</h3>
            <p>Covers all ready-made garments, headgear, shoes, sportswear, and fashion apparel. One of the most actively filed classes in India.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/trademark-registration/">Register in Class 25 &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🛒</div>
            <h3>Class 35 — Retail, E-Commerce & Advertising</h3>
            <p>Essential for retail stores, supermarkets, e-commerce platforms, distribution networks, business management, and marketing agencies.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/services/">Explore Service Filings &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">💻</div>
            <h3>Class 42 — Technology & Software (SaaS)</h3>
            <p>Covers software development, cloud hosting, SaaS platforms, IT architecture, and digital engineering services.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/contact/">Consult on Tech Brands &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🏨</div>
            <h3>Class 43 — Restaurants & Hospitality</h3>
            <p>Covers hotels, cafes, cloud kitchens, catering, food delivery services, and temporary accommodation providers.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/packages/food-brand/">Explore Hospitality Filings &rarr;</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🧴</div>
            <h3>Class 03 — Cosmetics & Cleaning</h3>
            <p>Covers beauty products, skincare formulations, soaps, perfumes, essential oils, and organic personal care goods.</p>
            <a class="card-link" href="/trademark-registration/">Protect Cosmetic Brands &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Important Considerations</p>
          <h2>How Class Selection Affects Your Application.</h2>
          <p>Careful classification prevents common registration setbacks and unnecessary expense.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">⚠️</div>
            <h3>Statutory Fees Are Per Class</h3>
            <p>Government fees apply to each class selected (₹4,500 per class for MSMEs/individuals, ₹9,000 for companies). Filing across multiple classes increases government fees proportionally.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">🔍</div>
            <h3>Class Overlaps Matter</h3>
            <p>A restaurant providing dine-in service (Class 43) that also sells packaged spices (Class 30) may require protection under both classes to achieve complete brand security.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon">📋</div>
            <h3>Accurate Specification</h3>
            <p>Drafting an overly broad specification may invite objections from the Registry or opposition from existing mark holders. Precision in wording is critical.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Need Guidance?</p>
          <h2>Not Sure Which Class Fits Your Business?</h2>
          <p>Share your product catalog or service description. We will examine the classification schedules and provide indicative guidance.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20please%20help%20me%20identify%20my%20trademark%20classes." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ask on WhatsApp &rarr;</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/trademark-registration/">Back to Trademark Registration</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
